getting you discharged in a week.

907
01:10:21.125 --> 01:10:22.956
So what?
- No. it's not done.

908
01:10:23.292 --> 01:10:25.408
It's been such a task
getting you to the hospital.

909
01:10:25.708 --> 01:10:27.619
You should spend at
least a month or two in here.

910
01:10:27.917 --> 01:10:31.705
Mean..- And while you are away.
we'll also have some peace.

911
01:10:31.792 --> 01:10:34.124
Rahul. I hate you.
You're so horrible. - Slowly..

912
01:10:34.208 --> 01:10:36.449
You're always making fun of me.
I hate you. You're so bad.

913
01:10:37.000 --> 01:10:38.365
Nisha. behave yourself.
Sorry. nurse.

914
01:10:38.458 --> 01:10:39.618
She has gone mad with the pain.

915
01:10:39.708 --> 01:10:41.744
But don't worry. I'll take
care of her. I'm a psychologist.

916
01:10:41.875 --> 01:10:42.955
Sis..
- Rahul.

917
01:10:43.208 --> 01:10:44.914
Yes?
- I'm sorry.

918
01:10:45.792 --> 01:10:46.872
For what?

919
01:10:48.042 --> 01:10:50.249
I've put you
through so much trouble.

920
01:10:51.417 --> 01:10:54.329
You've taken so much
money from the sponsors..

921
01:10:54.417 --> 01:10:57.329
..and how would you
find a dancer so soon?

922
01:10:58.500 --> 01:11:00.331
And for three months. l..
- Now look..

923
01:11:00.625 --> 01:11:03.537
..there's no need for you to worry.

924
01:11:04.083 --> 01:11:05.243
Rahul.
- Rahul's done for!

925
01:11:05.333 --> 01:11:06.869
What do you think?
You're a good dancer?

926
01:11:07.458 --> 01:11:09.824
There are scores of
fabulous dancers in town.

927
01:11:10.000 --> 01:11:13.322
Sure. but you'll never find..
- A dancer like you. right?

928
01:11:13.417 --> 01:11:16.784
Right.
- Now you don't worry about this.

929
01:11:16.917 --> 01:11:19.954
Now get some rest and
I'll see you in the evening.

930
01:11:20.042 --> 01:11:22.784
Okay. - And you don't need to
eat the boring hospital food.

931
01:11:22.875 --> 01:11:25.617
I'll bring some food.
We'll eat together.

932
01:11:26.042 --> 01:11:27.202
It's a deal. Right?

933
01:11:27.958 --> 01:11:29.289
Bye.
- Bye.

934
01:11:31.792 --> 01:11:34.158
Rahul.
- I know. Chinese. right?

935
01:11:34.417 --> 01:11:35.497
Right.

936
01:11:38.708 --> 01:11:41.245
Not to worry. It'll all work out.
- How will it all work out?

937
01:11:41.875 --> 01:11:42.955
We've borrowed money
from the sponsors.

938
01:11:43.042 --> 01:11:44.122
..and paid a
deposit for the stadium.

939
01:11:44.292 --> 01:11:46.408
Where are we going to
find a dancer like Nisha?

940
01:11:46.833 --> 01:11:49.870
Come on. if we try. don't you
think we can find one good dancer?

941
01:11:50.125 --> 01:11:51.956
There are plenty of dance schools.

942
01:11:52.083 --> 01:11:53.869
One is right next to
our rehearsal hall.

943
01:11:54.167 --> 01:11:55.873
We'll find a dancer there tomorrow.

944
01:11:55.958 --> 01:11:57.914
Yes! Yes. Jimmy. You're right.

945
01:11:58.375 --> 01:12:00.866
How about that.
Rahul? Come on. relax.

946
01:12:01.125 --> 01:12:02.661
Whatever happens
will be for the best.

947
01:12:03.000 --> 01:12:04.706
Let's go. and have
some chilled beer.

948
01:12:05.000 --> 01:12:06.991
No.. You go ahead. I'm not
in the mood. - Come on. buddy!.

949
01:12:07.500 --> 01:12:10.492
Relax. pal. Try to understand.
He's tired.

950
01:12:10.750 --> 01:12:12.160
Come on. we'll push off.
- See you guys. Take care.

951
01:12:12.500 --> 01:12:14.866
Bye. bye.
- Come on. Supandi. - I'll see you.?

952
01:12:14.958 --> 01:12:16.619
First you give me your
address and phone number.

953
01:12:17.875 --> 01:12:18.955
Maya..

954
01:12:21.417 --> 01:12:22.497
I'll find her.

955
01:16:03.750 --> 01:16:04.830
Maya.

956
01:16:41.250 --> 01:16:43.491
"Water. water."

957
01:16:43.750 --> 01:16:48.119
"Water. water in my eyes."
- Excuse me..

958
01:16:48.208 --> 01:16:49.823
The sandwich man.

959
01:16:50.167 --> 01:16:53.034
Shanti. has a parcel
come here by mistake? - No..

960
01:16:53.125 --> 01:16:56.117
I haven't come for a parcel today. -
Then tell me what I can do for you.

961
01:16:56.208 --> 01:16:59.655
I want to meet your daughter.
- I don't have a daughter.

962
01:17:00.125 --> 01:17:01.205
No daughter?
- No.

963
01:17:01.292 --> 01:17:03.453
Then sir. Ms. Pooja Malhotra?

964
01:17:04.042 --> 01:17:06.704
Pooja is like my daughter.
- I see.

965
01:17:06.833 --> 01:17:08.824
But how do you know her?

966
01:17:09.333 --> 01:17:11.949
I saw her last night.
- Night?

967
01:17:13.542 --> 01:17:15.749
Where?
- In the dancing school.

968
01:17:16.042 --> 01:17:17.828
She dances really well.
- So?

969
01:17:18.708 --> 01:17:20.323
So. I wanted to meet her.
- What for?

970
01:17:21.333 --> 01:17:23.198
I wanted to ask her something.
- What did you want to ask her?

971
01:17:23.792 --> 01:17:26.704
If she'd..sort of..with me..
- What with you?

972
01:17:27.167 --> 01:17:31.160
If she'd work with me.
- What work?

973
01:17:31.583 --> 01:17:35.155
I do plays. and I'm looking for
a dancer - You are doing a play.

974
01:17:35.875 --> 01:17:36.955
Yes.

975
01:17:37.125 --> 01:17:40.083
Are you a director?
- Yes. I'm sorry.

976
01:17:40.250 --> 01:17:43.117
I'm sorry. Why
didn't you tell me before?

977
01:17:43.208 --> 01:17:46.575
I did. when you asked me.
- I'm sorry. Come on in.

978
01:17:47.083 --> 01:17:49.244
Actually. I'm a singer.
- I see.

979
01:17:49.333 --> 01:17:52.496
I've done years of practice. Sit..

980
01:17:53.000 --> 01:17:55.082
As it happens with
many great artistes..

981
01:17:55.167 --> 01:17:58.614
..you don't really meet
too many connoisseurs.

982
01:17:58.792 --> 01:18:03.161
You've met me today. You
don't know how lucky you are.

983
01:18:03.292 --> 01:18:05.704
I know. sir but I've
come to meet Pooja.

984
01:18:05.792 --> 01:18:08.659
Now that you have met me.
you'll meet Pooja. too.

985
01:18:08.792 --> 01:18:10.623
I won't give you a
penny more than 75.

986
01:18:10.708 --> 01:18:14.030
The prices have gone up. ma'am.
Rs.80. no less.

987
01:18:14.458 --> 01:18:15.538
Only last week I bought it at..

988
01:18:15.625 --> 01:18:17.957
..that price and the prices
have shot up within a week?

989
01:18:18.042 --> 01:18:20.158
Trust me. ma'am.
That's the correct price.

990
01:18:20.292 --> 01:18:22.123
You can taste for
yourself how sweet it is.

991
01:18:22.208 --> 01:18:24.950
I will give you Rs.75 and no more.
- Seventy five..

992
01:18:25.042 --> 01:18:27.408
Show me the watermelon.
- Here you are. sir. - Show..

993
01:18:31.708 --> 01:18:33.619
Seventy-five is the right price.
How many do you want. Ma'am?

994
01:18:34.167 --> 01:18:35.828
Just one.
- Pack this for Ma'am.

995
01:18:35.917 --> 01:18:38.033
But..
- Oh. come on!

996
01:18:38.292 --> 01:18:40.453
It's your first sale in the day.
and you're haggling for five bucks?

997
01:18:41.125 --> 01:18:43.207
Come on. give it
to ma'am. I'm there.

998
01:18:46.917 --> 01:18:49.158
Hi.
- Hi.

999
01:18:50.167 --> 01:18:51.247
Recognize me?

1000
01:18:51.417 --> 01:18:53.703
We met last night at
your dancing school.

1001
01:18:54.250 --> 01:18:55.706
Remember?
- Oh. yes.

1002
01:18:56.500 --> 01:18:58.786
I'm Rahul. You must've heard of me?

1003
01:18:59.917 --> 01:19:00.952
No.

1004
01:19:01.042 --> 01:19:05.786
Well. never mind. Actually
you are a pretty good dancer.

1005
01:19:06.667 --> 01:19:07.747
Thank you.

1006
01:19:08.167 --> 01:19:11.159
Actually. I'm doing
some musical shows..

1007
01:19:11.250 --> 01:19:14.447
..and I need a special
dancer for a special role.

1008
01:19:15.167 --> 01:19:16.247
When I saw you dancing yesterday..

1009
01:19:16.333 --> 01:19:20.451
..I thought that
you'd be ideal for this.

1010
01:19:22.083 --> 01:19:25.120
So what do you think?
Would you be interested?

1011
01:19:26.750 --> 01:19:27.830
No. thanks.

1012
01:19:29.208 --> 01:19:30.243
Rahul is done for.

1013
01:19:30.375 --> 01:19:31.455
Sir. watermelon!

1014
01:19:31.542 --> 01:19:33.248
My career's at stake here and all
you can think of is that watermelon.

1015
01:19:33.333 --> 01:19:34.413
Here. take this. Watermelon.

1016
01:19:36.458 --> 01:19:38.665
Excuse me. but perhaps
you misunderstand me.

1017
01:19:38.750 --> 01:19:41.412
The shows I'm talking
about are no ordinary shows.

1018
01:19:41.583 --> 01:19:42.663
Here I am.

1019
01:19:42.750 --> 01:19:46.197
They're high-class shows with
a very high-class audience..

1020
01:19:46.292 --> 01:19:48.203
..and I am sure you
would also enjoy doing it.

1021
01:19:48.417 --> 01:19:49.907
Why don't you give it a try?

1022
01:19:50.333 --> 01:19:52.198
Not for me. for the sake of art.

1023
01:19:52.917 --> 01:19:56.034
Dancing is my hobby.
- That's really good.

1024
01:19:56.292 --> 01:19:59.580
But dancing on stage in front
of an audience makes me nervous.

1025
01:19:59.708 --> 01:20:01.994
What's there to be nervous?
- I don't think I can do it.

1026
01:20:02.083 --> 01:20:05.405
No. no.
- I'm sorry.. - No problem. Just..

1027
01:20:07.375 --> 01:20:08.455
Take 3.

1028
01:20:10.833 --> 01:20:12.448
Excuse me. I'm sorry.

1029
01:20:12.708 --> 01:20:14.539
Look. I'm in a tight spot.

1030
01:20:14.792 --> 01:20:16.783
Actually. my lead dancer
has fractured her foot.

1031
01:20:16.958 --> 01:20:18.323
I've already
borrowed money for the show.

1032
01:20:18.583 --> 01:20:21.495
If we don't perform. I'll not only
incur a loss but also lose face.

1033
01:20:21.625 --> 01:20:25.322
Just come once for a rehearsal.
and if you don't like it. it's fine.

1034
01:20:25.417 --> 01:20:27.999
But please. just once.
Please come to the rehearsal.

1035
01:20:28.083 --> 01:20:31.280
I'm really very sorry.
- Please - I can't do it.

1036
01:20:31.375 --> 01:20:34.082
Please.
- Why don't you hire someone else?

1037
01:20:34.917 --> 01:20:36.248
I beg of you. please.
- What are you doing?

1038
01:20:36.333 --> 01:20:38.665
You don't know me. I'm a
stubborn and crazy guy.

1039
01:20:38.917 --> 01:20:40.657
I'm not budging until you agree.
- Look. Please get up.

1040
01:20:40.750 --> 01:20:41.830
Please come just
once to a rehearsal.

1041
01:20:41.917 --> 01:20:42.997
Don't come back if you don't
want to. - Everyone's looking at us.

1042
01:20:43.083 --> 01:20:44.414
Please. Please come. just once!

1043
01:20:44.500 --> 01:20:46.741
Okay. I'll come. -You will?
Promise? - Promise.

1044
01:20:47.000 --> 01:20:48.410
When?
- Tomorrow. - What time?

1045
01:20:48.583 --> 01:20:50.039
2:00pm.
- Can't you come at one?

1046
01:20:50.125 --> 01:20:53.572
Okay. I'll come at one. - Thank you
very much. Thank you for all this.

1047
01:20:55.000 --> 01:20:56.080
By the way. I hope you know that..

1048
01:20:56.167 --> 01:20:57.703
..our rehearsal hall is right
next to your dancing school.

1049
01:20:57.833 --> 01:20:59.869
I know. - We're neighbors.
you know. - I know.

1050
01:21:00.167 --> 01:21:02.328
Thank you very much. Thank you.
Thank you very much.

1051
01:21:05.250 --> 01:21:06.330
Ma'am.

1052
01:21:06.833 --> 01:21:08.039
You'll come. won't you?

1053
01:21:10.375 --> 01:21:11.535
Yes. you will.

1054
01:21:13.708 --> 01:21:14.788
Ma'am.

1055
01:21:16.375 --> 01:21:17.455
Yes.

1056
01:21:19.292 --> 01:21:21.078
For you. Yes.

1057
01:21:25.542 --> 01:21:26.657
He's crazy.

1058
01:21:29.792 --> 01:21:32.579
How is this sketch?
- No that good. This one's better.

1059
01:21:32.667 --> 01:21:33.747
Sir.

1060
01:21:33.833 --> 01:21:36.575
That's okay. But this one. this is
what I don't like. Make this proper.

1061
01:21:36.792 --> 01:21:37.872
I'll do that.

1062
01:21:37.958 --> 01:21:40.495
The color scheme's okay. Okay.

1063
01:21:40.583 --> 01:21:41.663
But look at this one.
here. this one..

1064
01:21:42.958 --> 01:21:45.916
Rahul. you said that
girl would come at 1 :00pm..

1065
01:21:46.250 --> 01:21:48.536
It's already 4:00pm. I
don't think she'll come.

1066
01:21:48.750 --> 01:21:49.830
So what should I do?

1067
01:21:50.167 --> 01:21:51.703
So if she doesn't come.
won't we do our play?

1068
01:21:52.083 --> 01:21:54.074
I was only..
- Go and get on with your own thing.

1069
01:21:54.417 --> 01:21:56.123
Go.
- Okay. relax.

1070
01:21:58.958 --> 01:22:02.951
What happened?
- Please. don't disturb me.

1071
01:22:06.333 --> 01:22:07.823
Quiet. quiet everybody.

1072
01:22:11.333 --> 01:22:13.619
Ballu. spotlight on the entrance.

1073
01:22:34.000 --> 01:22:35.706
Hi.
- Hi.

1074
01:22:37.375 --> 01:22:40.117
Rahul. You must've heard of me?

1075
01:22:59.542 --> 01:23:01.624
Cut it. No. no.

1076
01:23:03.625 --> 01:23:04.865
No. Pooja. No.

1077
01:23:05.875 --> 01:23:06.955
No. Pooja.

1078
01:23:07.500 --> 01:23:09.741
You're not putting
your heart into it.

1079
01:23:10.125 --> 01:23:13.322
You are concentrating
more on the steps and music.

1080
01:23:14.750 --> 01:23:18.493
I don't want to see
how well you dance.

1081
01:23:18.583 --> 01:23:20.323
I have already seen that.
and you are very good.

1082
01:23:21.083 --> 01:23:24.655
I want to see whether
you are Maya or not.

1083
01:23:25.875 --> 01:23:29.197
I want to see the zenith
of Maya's love and passion.

1084
01:23:30.500 --> 01:23:34.618
I want to see what happens
when Maya pours her heart out.

1085
01:23:35.708 --> 01:23:36.788
Right?

1086
01:23:37.417 --> 01:23:39.499
Okay. We'll try it once more.

1087
01:23:43.417 --> 01:23:44.782
All right. music.

1088
01:23:59.583 --> 01:24:00.663
Cut it!

1089
01:24:00.750 --> 01:24:02.331
Why don't you understand
what I'm trying to tell you?

1090
01:24:03.458 --> 01:24:04.573
Forget that there's
anyone sitting here.

1091
01:24:05.083 --> 01:24:06.198
Forget that there's music playing.

1092
01:24:06.583 --> 01:24:09.120
Forget that this is a rehearsal.
Just think of Maya.

1093
01:24:09.375 --> 01:24:10.660
God knows where you're lost.

1094
01:24:10.875 --> 01:24:13.537
I've cried myself hoarse that
I don't want to see your dance.

1095
01:24:13.750 --> 01:24:16.162
I don't want to see you dance.
I want to see your madness!

1096
01:24:16.375 --> 01:24:18.206
Maya's madness..

1097
01:24:22.167 --> 01:24:24.123
I'm sorry. Pooja.
- Don't touch me.

1098
01:24:26.125 --> 01:24:28.662
I'm really sorry. Pooja.
I was just..

1099
01:24:28.750 --> 01:24:30.832
Never in my life has
anyone yelled at me like that.

1100
01:24:31.083 --> 01:24:33.620
I know. Pooja. I'm an idiot.

1101
01:24:33.875 --> 01:24:35.831
I don't know how to talk to girls.

1102
01:24:35.958 --> 01:24:38.199
I told you I can't do it.

1103
01:24:38.375 --> 01:24:39.911
But you're doing it really well.

1104
01:24:40.500 --> 01:24:42.240
It's just that I'm
going on about Maya.

1105
01:24:42.333 --> 01:24:44.324
I don't understand this Maya.
- Never mind..

1106
01:24:44.417 --> 01:24:46.829
I don't want to do this. - Don't
worry if you don't understand.

1107
01:24:47.167 --> 01:24:50.534
We don't have to do this today.
We can do it tomorrow. Okay?

1108
01:24:50.750 --> 01:24:53.583
I don't want to do it tomorrow
either. I'm not doing this. - Okay.

1109
01:24:53.792 --> 01:24:55.999
Maya. relax.
- My name is Pooja.

1110
01:24:56.875 --> 01:24:58.411
Of course. it's Pooja.

1111
01:24:59.750 --> 01:25:02.537
I'm sorry. Sit down. please. Sit

1112
01:25:02.917 --> 01:25:06.489
I'm really sorry. Pooja. Don't
dance if you don't want to..

1113
01:25:06.583 --> 01:25:07.663
..but please stop crying.

1114
01:25:08.125 --> 01:25:09.205
Don't want water? No problem.

1115
01:25:09.333 --> 01:25:12.120
You see Pooja. it's a habit
with me to yell during rehearsals.

1116
01:25:12.583 --> 01:25:14.323
I wasn't having a go at you.

1117
01:25:15.458 --> 01:25:19.622
I was only trying to explain
to you about Maya that's all.

1118
01:25:20.833 --> 01:25:24.701
Pooja. maybe you just
don't understand Maya.

1119
01:25:27.167 --> 01:25:29.499
Maya is the kind of girl..

1120
01:25:29.583 --> 01:25:34.282
..who lives in a dream world.

1121
01:25:35.792 --> 01:25:40.536
She believes that one day
her dream prince will come..

1122
01:25:40.625 --> 01:25:42.286
..and carry her away.

1123
01:25:43.542 --> 01:25:46.534
Her friends have
always made fun of her..

1124
01:25:46.625 --> 01:25:48.286
..but that did not shake her belief.

1125
01:25:50.333 --> 01:25:54.531
And today. she has met
the man of her dreams..

1126
01:25:54.625 --> 01:25:57.458
..and she's dancing.

1127
01:25:58.875 --> 01:26:00.536
There is love in her dance..

1128
01:26:01.542 --> 01:26:03.624
There's mad passion and arrogance.

1129
01:26:04.750 --> 01:26:11.576
As if to say. "I
knew he would come.."

1130
01:26:11.667 --> 01:26:18.493
"..and now. see. he has
come." "My dream man has come."

1131
01:26:46.917 --> 01:26:47.997
Music.

1132
01:27:22.167 --> 01:27:28.242
Wow. wonderful. - Brilliant.
- Brilliant. - Thank you.

1133
01:27:35.042 --> 01:27:36.157
It was nice.

1134
01:27:36.417 --> 01:27:38.453
Brilliant. Absolutely brilliant.

1135
01:27:38.667 --> 01:27:42.364
Nisha. I can't believe we got
such a good girl so quickly!

1136
01:27:42.708 --> 01:27:45.666
Had I not got the
right girl for this role..

1137
01:27:45.750 --> 01:27:46.830
..I'd have cancelled the play..

1138
01:27:46.917 --> 01:27:50.114
..given back the money. and
willingly faced the music.

1139
01:27:51.167 --> 01:27:53.249
But I was destined to meet Pooja.

1140
01:27:55.208 --> 01:27:57.324
Her name is Pooja?
- No. it's Jeetendra.

1141
01:27:57.667 --> 01:27:58.747
Of course it's Pooja.

1142
01:28:01.292 --> 01:28:04.284
Is she beautiful?
- Really beautiful.

1143
01:28:04.750 --> 01:28:07.947
Remember how I described Maya?
She's just like her.

1144
01:28:08.792 --> 01:28:13.456
That innocent face. those
dreamy eyes and that bashfulness.

1145
01:28:15.292 --> 01:28:17.328
She is too good.
Nisha. She's brilliant.

1146
01:28:17.750 --> 01:28:18.830
Yes.

1147
01:28:20.042 --> 01:28:21.282
Is she a good dancer?

1148
01:28:21.583 --> 01:28:24.245
When she dances. you
can't take your eyes off her.

1149
01:28:24.375 --> 01:28:26.957
I know that you will go
crazy when you see her.

1150
01:28:27.167 --> 01:28:28.282
I see.
- Yes.

1151
01:28:28.750 --> 01:28:31.082
But can she act?

1152
01:28:31.208 --> 01:28:34.951
But of course. she can. If
she can't act. what am I for?

1153
01:28:35.167 --> 01:28:38.489
If I can get you to act
I can get anyone to act.

1154
01:28:38.792 --> 01:28:39.872
Very funny.

1155
01:28:41.000 --> 01:28:43.457
There's no water. no soft drink
and you've called me for dinner.

1156
01:28:43.792 --> 01:28:45.999
Wait a minute. and I'll
get something to drink.

1157
01:28:49.208 --> 01:28:50.288
Rahul.

1158
01:28:52.125 --> 01:28:53.615
Is she as good a dancer as mc?

1159
01:28:54.333 --> 01:28:57.905
Are you crazy? There's
no dancer as good as you.

1160
01:28:58.375 --> 01:29:00.115
Right.
- Right.

1161
01:29:05.917 --> 01:29:06.997
Idiot.

1162
01:29:08.000 --> 01:29:09.536
Can't even lie properly.

1163
01:30:48.000 --> 01:30:50.537
There go your pants.

1164
01:30:57.000 --> 01:30:58.160
The stitches gave away.

1165
01:31:07.542 --> 01:31:09.498
Hey Shruti. get my bag.
- Relax.

1166
01:31:09.583 --> 01:31:14.498
Let's go! -Okay. we'll push
off now. See you tomorrow..

1167
01:31:14.583 --> 01:31:16.744
Bye..
- See you tomorrow.

1168
01:31:30.292 --> 01:31:31.498
May I say something. Pooja?
- What?

1169
01:31:32.792 --> 01:31:36.455
When you smile..
- I know. I look good.

1170
01:31:38.083 --> 01:31:39.163
Then?

1171
01:31:39.375 --> 01:31:42.367
When you laugh. it rains.

1172
01:31:43.958 --> 01:31:45.038
Give it back.

1173
01:31:51.875 --> 01:31:55.538
"With the gait of a horse.
with the majesty of an elephant."

1174
01:31:56.250 --> 01:31:59.913
"Oh. king of the rains.
where do you come from?"

1175
01:32:00.667 --> 01:32:04.330
"With the gait of a horse.
with the majesty of an elephant."

1176
01:32:05.083 --> 01:32:08.746
"Oh. king of the rains.
where do you come from?"

1177
01:32:31.458 --> 01:32:35.827
"l know a girl. when she smiles.."

1178
01:32:40.333 --> 01:32:57.160
"l know a girl. when she smiles.
the rains come pouring down."

1179
01:32:57.958 --> 01:33:02.452
"l know a boy. when he sings.."

1180
01:33:06.458 --> 01:33:14.741
"l know a boy. when he sings.
the rain clouds mask the sky."

1181
01:33:15.042 --> 01:33:23.541
"l know a boy. when he sings.
the rain clouds mask the sky."

1182
01:33:55.375 --> 01:33:59.288
"The clouds have descended.."

1183
01:33:59.708 --> 01:34:03.701
"They stand in our path."

1184
01:34:04.333 --> 01:34:08.155
"Tell us what your
intentions are. oh clouds."

1185
01:34:08.667 --> 01:34:11.989
"Won't you let us go home?"

1186
01:34:12.708 --> 01:34:16.576
"There's rain ahead.
a storm behind."

1187
01:34:17.125 --> 01:34:20.697
"The weather is treacherous.
Oh. where can we go?"

1188
01:34:26.042 --> 01:34:33.949
"l know a girl. when she smiles.
the rains come pouring down."

1189
01:34:34.792 --> 01:34:42.745
"l know a boy. when he sings.
the rain clouds mask the sky."

1190
01:35:23.417 --> 01:35:27.285
"The heavy sky
stoops low with clouds."

1191
01:35:27.708 --> 01:35:31.496
"Everything has
come to a standstill."

1192
01:35:32.250 --> 01:35:36.368
"How lovely is this season."

1193
01:35:36.542 --> 01:35:39.909
"Take the sign of the rains."

1194
01:35:40.750 --> 01:35:44.368
"in such a weather. say something.."

1195
01:35:45.083 --> 01:35:48.780
"..do something. Why
do you stand silent?"

1196
01:35:56.208 --> 01:35:59.826
"With the gait of a horse.
with the majesty of an elephant."

1197
01:36:00.583 --> 01:36:04.201
"Oh king of the rains.
where do you come from?"

1198
01:36:04.958 --> 01:36:08.621
"With the gait of a horse.
with the majesty of an elephant."

1199
01:36:09.333 --> 01:36:12.905
"Oh king of the rains.
where do you come from?"

1200
01:36:40.250 --> 01:36:48.203
"l know a girl. when she smiles.
the rains come pouring down."

1201
01:36:48.958 --> 01:36:57.036
"l know a boy. when he sings.
the rain clouds mask the sky."

1202
01:37:46.208 --> 01:37:49.951
The doctor has said clearly that
you can't go out of the house.

1203
01:37:50.292 --> 01:37:52.874
There's no need for you to
strain yourself trying to get up.

1204
01:37:53.333 --> 01:37:55.619
Now get into your bed. and rest.

1205
01:37:57.417 --> 01:37:59.578
Who are you calling now?

1206
01:37:59.792 --> 01:38:02.249
Rahul.
- Oh yes. he called..

1207
01:38:02.333 --> 01:38:06.121
..to say that he's at Soni's house.

1208
01:38:06.417 --> 01:38:10.080
At Soni's? Oh yes. Soni and
Jimmy are getting engaged today.

1209
01:38:10.333 --> 01:38:13.655
Aunt. get my clothes out quickly.
I want to go there. I'll just come.

1210
01:38:13.792 --> 01:38:16.033
Look. I'll call the doctor.
- Aunt. please!

1211
01:38:16.333 --> 01:38:17.539
She just won't listen.

1212
01:38:19.250 --> 01:38:23.243
"The girl is beautiful.."

1213
01:38:23.333 --> 01:38:27.372
"The boy looks morose.."

1214
01:38:27.500 --> 01:38:29.707
"The two don't match.."

1215
01:38:31.708 --> 01:38:37.749
"The two don't match.."
"They don't make a good pair.."

1216
01:38:37.833 --> 01:38:39.414
I'll not give this to you.

1217
01:38:41.250 --> 01:38:42.365
I hate these weddings.

1218
01:38:43.083 --> 01:38:45.039
I don't understand
why people get married.

1219
01:38:45.458 --> 01:38:49.280
If two people have decided to
spend their whole lives together..

1220
01:38:49.375 --> 01:38:52.117
..why are the others
making such a fuss?

1221
01:38:52.292 --> 01:38:53.372
Why are they all getting excited?

1222
01:38:53.875 --> 01:38:54.955
These days it has become a fashion..

1223
01:38:55.042 --> 01:38:58.079
..to have seven days
long wedding celebrations.

1224
01:38:58.375 --> 01:38:59.455
Give me a break.

1225
01:38:59.875 --> 01:39:02.332
Get married. have a quiet ceremony.
and then go home and sleep.

1226
01:39:02.792 --> 01:39:05.204
I've even come to hate
the word 'marriage'.

1227
01:39:05.375 --> 01:39:07.115
Excuse me. may I have another one?

1228
01:39:07.542 --> 01:39:10.284
But the one good thing
is that in all this fuss..

1229
01:39:10.375 --> 01:39:11.660
..you get lots of goodies to eat.

1230
01:39:11.958 --> 01:39:13.038
Thank you. Have you eaten?

1231
01:39:13.333 --> 01:39:14.413
Later.
- Let's sit.

1232
01:39:14.875 --> 01:39:16.206
I really love weddings.

1233
01:39:17.125 --> 01:39:20.322
The small rituals. dancing.
singing. and making merry..

1234
01:39:20.417 --> 01:39:22.999
..I love every bit of it.
- Very good.

1235
01:39:24.333 --> 01:39:25.948
I'm going to have all
of them at my wedding.

1236
01:39:27.708 --> 01:39:28.788
Are you getting married?

1237
01:39:31.917 --> 01:39:32.952
Yes.

1238
01:39:37.500 --> 01:39:38.910
I mean. you never mentioned it.

1239
01:39:40.958 --> 01:39:42.038
When are you going to do it?

1240
01:39:42.708 --> 01:39:44.539
Actually. nothing is fixed yet.

1241
01:39:45.458 --> 01:39:46.948
He works abroad.

1242
01:39:47.667 --> 01:39:48.747
When he comes back..

1243
01:39:48.833 --> 01:39:52.280
..we'll fix a date when
we've found an auspicious time.

1244
01:39:53.167 --> 01:39:55.123
That's why I haven't
mentioned this to anyone.

1245
01:39:56.042 --> 01:39:58.203
I see. Congratulations.

1246
01:39:59.708 --> 01:40:00.788
Thanks.

1247
01:40:05.000 --> 01:40:07.958
Rahul. when are you
getting married to Nisha?

1248
01:40:09.417 --> 01:40:11.032
Nisha and me? Are you crazy?

1249
01:40:11.708 --> 01:40:13.198
The two of us are just good friends.

1250
01:40:13.500 --> 01:40:15.365
There's no chance of us
ever getting married..

1251
01:40:15.458 --> 01:40:17.619
..and in any case
marriage and me. no thank you.

1252
01:40:18.292 --> 01:40:21.455
Actually. I don't believe at all
in the institution of marriage.

1253
01:40:22.208 --> 01:40:23.368
I don't know how two people decide..

1254
01:40:23.458 --> 01:40:25.824
..to spend their whole
life with each other.

1255
01:40:26.042 --> 01:40:28.408
I fail to
understand and I'm certain..

1256
01:40:28.500 --> 01:40:33.540
..there can't be a girl who
could spend her whole life with me!

1257
01:40:34.125 --> 01:40:36.707
You're mistaken.
There is one such girl.

1258
01:40:37.125 --> 01:40:40.447
Where is she?
- Somewhere or the other.

1259
01:40:42.500 --> 01:40:43.580
Rubbish.

1260
01:40:45.500 --> 01:40:49.869
I've always believed that God
made all relationships of the heart.

1261
01:40:51.000 --> 01:40:52.536
But then He left it to
us to find each other.

1262
01:40:54.042 --> 01:40:55.782
He created all of us in pairs.

1263
01:40:56.583 --> 01:40:59.040
For every one of us
there is a soul-mate.

1264
01:40:59.958 --> 01:41:02.119
You just have to
wait till you meet her.

1265
01:41:03.833 --> 01:41:06.324
Do you think that's true?

1266
01:41:06.542 --> 01:41:08.282
At least in my life.
that's the ultimate truth.

1267
01:41:10.500 --> 01:41:11.580
True.

1268
01:41:14.500 --> 01:41:17.788
That means that you've
found your soul mate.

1269
01:41:19.750 --> 01:41:21.160
Yes. I've found him.

1270
01:41:22.083 --> 01:41:24.039
I found my soul mate.

1271
01:41:31.792 --> 01:41:33.498
Something is amiss.
- What?

1272
01:41:35.292 --> 01:41:37.999
The dessert is amazing. Have some.
- No.

1273
01:41:38.792 --> 01:41:39.872
Okay.

1274
01:41:45.542 --> 01:41:46.622
I don't know where he keeps it..

1275
01:41:46.708 --> 01:41:49.905
..Nisha! When were you discharged
from the hospital? - Hey. Ballu.

1276
01:41:50.125 --> 01:41:51.706
I ran away from hospital.
- Great.

1277
01:41:52.000 --> 01:41:53.956
Jimmy and Soni will be
delighted to see you.

1278
01:41:54.042 --> 01:41:56.249
Where are they? - They are sitting
in the lawn. go and meet them.

1279
01:41:56.500 --> 01:42:00.539
Rahul is there. isn't he?
- Rahul's gone to drop Pooja home.

1280
01:42:00.625 --> 01:42:02.240
Ballu.
- Coming. You go ahead.

1281
01:42:03.167 --> 01:42:06.739
"He has come. he has
come with a sword.."

1282
01:42:06.833 --> 01:42:07.913
Pooja.

1283
01:42:13.708 --> 01:42:15.494
Thanks. See you tomorrow.

1284
01:42:15.583 --> 01:42:17.073
Pooja.
- What?

1285
01:42:19.125 --> 01:42:21.616
It's that story you
told me at Soni's.

1286
01:42:22.667 --> 01:42:25.409
That some special girl
is made for me..etc. etc..

1287
01:42:26.208 --> 01:42:27.323
I've been thinking about that.

1288
01:42:29.083 --> 01:42:31.825
I don't get something.
- What?

1289
01:42:33.542 --> 01:42:37.239
How would I know who's made for me?

1290
01:42:37.750 --> 01:42:39.411
You have so much
faith in this theory.

1291
01:42:39.917 --> 01:42:42.408
I'm sure you know how I'm
going to meet this girl.

1292
01:42:42.917 --> 01:42:47.456
I mean. will she be holding
a placard with my name on it?

1293
01:42:47.958 --> 01:42:49.539
Or. when I see her would
there be a clap of thunder..

1294
01:42:49.625 --> 01:42:51.536
..and a bolt of lightning?

1295
01:42:51.625 --> 01:42:52.910
Would music start playing?
What would happen?

1296
01:42:54.833 --> 01:42:55.913
He will tell you.

1297
01:42:56.875 --> 01:42:58.240
He will give just one sign..

1298
01:42:58.750 --> 01:43:00.957
..and your heart
would recognize the girl.

1299
01:47:19.542 --> 01:47:21.999
I've tried reasoning with her..
but she just wouldn't listen.

1300
01:47:22.667 --> 01:47:24.328
She does what she wants.
- Hi. Doctor.

1301
01:47:24.500 --> 01:47:26.866
Doctor.
- Rahul. good you came.

1302
01:47:27.292 --> 01:47:29.829
I'm fed up with this girl.
- Why? What happened?

1303
01:47:30.167 --> 01:47:34.115
I told her clearly that she
needs to stay at home to rest.

1304
01:47:34.542 --> 01:47:37.705
But look at her. she's
packing her bags to go somewhere.

1305
01:47:38.125 --> 01:47:40.286
Where to?
- How would I know?

1306
01:47:40.792 --> 01:47:43.454
I've tried my best to explain.
- She doesn't listen to me.

1307
01:47:43.542 --> 01:47:45.703
You're the only one
who could convince her.

1308
01:47:45.875 --> 01:47:48.207
Don't worry. she won't go anywhere.

1309
01:47:48.292 --> 01:47:49.657
I'll go in and take
her to task right away.

1310
01:47:49.750 --> 01:47:51.957
Okay? - Best of luck.
- Okay. see you. - Bye

1311
01:47:54.000 --> 01:47:55.080
Nisha.

1312
01:47:57.958 --> 01:48:00.449
What are you doing. Nisha?
Are you nuts?

1313
01:48:00.792 --> 01:48:02.157
The doctor told you to rest. right?

1314
01:48:02.542 --> 01:48:04.203
By the way. where are you off to?

1315
01:48:04.583 --> 01:48:06.574
I'm going to London.
- London?

1316
01:48:07.042 --> 01:48:08.828
Well. Mum and Dad keep calling me..

1317
01:48:08.917 --> 01:48:11.499
..and it's been
months since I met them.

1318
01:48:12.667 --> 01:48:13.827
I thought I'd visit them.

1319
01:48:14.167 --> 01:48:16.829
Besides. I want to
run away from here.

1320
01:48:17.458 --> 01:48:19.039
Want to run away? From whom?

1321
01:48:21.000 --> 01:48:23.491
From myself.
- What's all this nonsense. Nisha?

1322
01:48:25.375 --> 01:48:27.115
I've begun to get
scared of myself. Rahul.

1323
01:48:29.833 --> 01:48:31.198
I want to leave..

1324
01:48:32.833 --> 01:48:34.494
..so that I can avoid doing
things like the one I did yesterday.

1325
01:48:34.583 --> 01:48:37.040
Nisha. you haven't
done anything of the sort.

1326
01:48:37.250 --> 01:48:38.490
You were just dancing.

1327
01:48:38.583 --> 01:48:39.993
Look here..
- Rahul..

1328
01:48:40.958 --> 01:48:44.075
..now we should stop
evading the truth.

1329
01:48:45.333 --> 01:48:48.450
We both know what the problem is.

1330
01:48:50.000 --> 01:48:51.080
What's the problem?

1331
01:48:53.667 --> 01:48:54.827
The problem is that..

1332
01:48:54.917 --> 01:49:00.457
..I love you. and you don't love me.

1333
01:49:05.542 --> 01:49:08.864
Look here. Nisha..
- I know..

1334
01:49:08.958 --> 01:49:13.031
..that you know how much I love you.

1335
01:49:14.750 --> 01:49:15.910
That night I wasn't sizzled enough..

1336
01:49:16.000 --> 01:49:19.618
..to not hear what
my heart was saying.

1337
01:49:21.250 --> 01:49:25.869
Actually. Rahul. we've
become such good friends..

1338
01:49:25.958 --> 01:49:29.780
..that we take each
other for granted.

1339
01:49:31.083 --> 01:49:36.828
So I think that a bit of
space will give us time to think.

1340
01:49:39.000 --> 01:49:40.911
But I'm sure..

1341
01:49:41.000 --> 01:49:45.949
..that when I'm not here.
you'll miss me a lot.

1342
01:49:46.917 --> 01:49:49.124
Then maybe then
you'd realize my worth.

1343
01:49:49.917 --> 01:49:53.910
One thing is certain.
that an idiot like you..

1344
01:49:54.000 --> 01:49:56.286
..doesn't deserve a girl like me.

1345
01:49:57.667 --> 01:50:00.909
And I don't know why.
but I feel that..

1346
01:50:01.000 --> 01:50:02.911
.. when I come back..

1347
01:50:03.000 --> 01:50:09.701
..you'll be on your knees
begging me to get married to you.

1348
01:50:10.708 --> 01:50:12.869
And who knows at that point in
time I may not be in the mood for it.

1349
01:50:14.250 --> 01:50:15.330
Get lost.

1350
01:50:15.708 --> 01:50:16.868
Well. maybe you
haven't seen your face..

1351
01:50:17.292 --> 01:50:18.327
It's better than yours.

1352
01:50:19.667 --> 01:50:25.082
Hey. Nisha..
- Rahul.

1353
01:50:32.167 --> 01:50:35.705
Nisha. you're really nice.

1354
01:50:37.125 --> 01:50:38.786
I know. Come on now..

1355
01:50:38.875 --> 01:50:40.786
I must meet everyone on
my way to the airport.

1356
01:50:41.417 --> 01:50:42.657
Come on. Rahul. hurry up.

1357
01:50:49.958 --> 01:50:51.698
We'll see you.
- Bye. see you guys.

1358
01:50:51.792 --> 01:50:53.783
Take care..
- I'll really miss you. - Thanks.

1359
01:50:54.083 --> 01:50:56.290
Bye.
- Enjoy yourself.

1360
01:50:56.542 --> 01:50:59.284
Take care.
- Bye. Nisha. - Bye buddy.

1361
01:50:59.375 --> 01:51:00.990
Rahul. has our stuff arrived?

1362
01:51:01.083 --> 01:51:05.281
Ballu is mad.

1363
01:51:07.000 --> 01:51:08.991
We haven't been properly introduced.

1364
01:51:09.667 --> 01:51:11.658
Let's start from the beginning.

1365
01:51:12.167 --> 01:51:14.203
Hi! I'm Nisha.
- I'm Pooja.

1366
01:51:15.375 --> 01:51:16.990
Now that we are friends..

1367
01:51:17.083 --> 01:51:21.998
..will you forgive me
for what I did yesterday?

1368
01:51:22.333 --> 01:51:24.415
Forgive you? For what?

1369
01:51:24.917 --> 01:51:29.206
Pooja. what I did with you
yesterday. wasn't right.

1370
01:51:30.292 --> 01:51:32.999
Actually. ever since
this place was built..

1371
01:51:33.083 --> 01:51:36.200
..I'm the only one
who's danced on this floor.

1372
01:51:37.292 --> 01:51:39.283
This floor has become my identity.

1373
01:51:40.042 --> 01:51:46.368
So when I heard that someone else
had taken my place.. I felt bad.

1374
01:51:47.375 --> 01:51:50.333
Without seeing you or
knowing you. I was jealous.

1375
01:51:51.708 --> 01:51:53.369
I shouldn't have felt that way.

1376
01:51:54.208 --> 01:51:56.950
Had I been in your place.
I'd have done the same.

1377
01:51:57.708 --> 01:52:00.700
Moreover. I really
enjoyed dancing with you.

1378
01:52:01.667 --> 01:52:03.248
You were the one dancing.

1379
01:52:04.458 --> 01:52:05.948
I was doing something else.

1380
01:52:07.625 --> 01:52:09.661
I'm really sorry. Pooja.
- It's okay

1381
01:52:09.750 --> 01:52:11.741
Come on. Nisha. The pilot of
your flight just called for you.

1382
01:52:12.417 --> 01:52:16.786
I always told Rahul that there could
never be another dancer like me.

1383
01:52:17.417 --> 01:52:18.497
But I can't say that any more.

1384
01:52:19.708 --> 01:52:20.788
And I'm sure that..

1385
01:52:20.875 --> 01:52:24.117
..no one can play the role
of Maya better than you.

1386
01:52:24.583 --> 01:52:26.790
Not even me. All the best..

1387
01:52:26.875 --> 01:52:28.115
Bye. See you.
- Thank you! Bye.

1388
01:52:28.375 --> 01:52:29.455
Come.

1389
01:52:29.542 --> 01:52:33.160
Who is coming to drop
me to the airport? - Me!

1390
01:53:26.375 --> 01:53:27.956
Hi. I'm Rahul.

1391
01:53:28.708 --> 01:53:29.788
You must have heard of me?

1392
01:53:30.500 --> 01:53:32.365
I'm looking for a special
dancer for a special role.

1393
01:53:32.875 --> 01:53:37.414
I saw you dance yesterday and
felt you would be ideal for this.

1394
01:53:39.625 --> 01:53:41.411
Check. check.. 69..

1395
01:53:41.625 --> 01:53:44.037
Ballu. what are you doing?
Throw the spotlight properly.

1396
01:53:45.292 --> 01:53:48.784
Pooja. good. good. But..

1397
01:53:50.292 --> 01:53:53.409
I think that you are not opening up.

1398
01:53:54.125 --> 01:53:57.242
I want to see how Maya
looks when she's happy.

1399
01:53:57.708 --> 01:54:01.747
I want to see the zenith of
Maya's passion and love. Okay?

1400
01:54:02.583 --> 01:54:04.448
Do it again. Okay.

1401
01:54:05.500 --> 01:54:08.082
Quiet everybody.
Take it from the top.

1402
01:54:09.167 --> 01:54:10.247
Music!

1403
01:54:11.167 --> 01:54:12.407
Cut it! Cut it!

1404
01:54:12.708 --> 01:54:14.164
Haven't I told you to
forget that you are you..

1405
01:54:14.250 --> 01:54:16.206
..to forget that there
are people sitting here?

1406
01:54:16.292 --> 01:54:17.372
Forget that there's a
rehearsal going on here.

1407
01:54:17.583 --> 01:54:18.663
But you refuse to understand.

1408
01:54:18.917 --> 01:54:19.997
Pack up.

1409
01:54:22.917 --> 01:54:24.828
I don't get one thing. Pooja.

1410
01:54:25.917 --> 01:54:28.408
How I would know which
girl was made for me?

1411
01:54:29.333 --> 01:54:31.870
Will she be holding a
placard with my name on it?

1412
01:54:31.958 --> 01:54:34.199
When I see her. would
there be a clap of thunder..

1413
01:54:34.292 --> 01:54:35.407
..and a flash of lightning?

1414
01:56:22.583 --> 01:56:28.499
"Oh dear. what's happening?
I don't really know."

1415
01:56:29.042 --> 01:56:35.322
"l only hope this does not
turn into a tale of love."

1416
01:56:35.458 --> 01:56:41.283
"Oh dear. what's going on?
Nobody really knows."

1417
01:56:41.917 --> 01:56:47.958
"But if this is a tale
of love. then so be it."

1418
01:57:36.708 --> 01:57:41.782
"Take my hand in yours.
as long as you are here."

1419
01:57:43.125 --> 01:57:48.370
"Let's sit talking.
as long as we can."

1420
01:57:49.458 --> 01:57:53.371
"Let's look into
each other's eyes.."

1421
01:57:53.458 --> 01:57:55.665
"..as long as the night lasts."

1422
01:57:56.042 --> 01:58:02.868
"Oh dear. what's going on?
Nobody really knows."

1423
01:58:08.833 --> 01:58:14.123
"How do I describe
the state of my heart?"

1424
01:58:15.375 --> 01:58:20.745
"Even the dewdrops seem to burn.
with the fever of my heart."

1425
01:58:21.792 --> 01:58:28.072
"Why do I feel as if
someone has caressed me"

1426
01:58:28.167 --> 01:58:31.239
"Oh dear. what's going on?"

1427
01:58:31.500 --> 01:58:34.242
"l don't really know."

1428
01:58:34.625 --> 01:58:40.621
"l only hope this does not
turn into a tale of love."

1429
01:58:41.167 --> 01:58:43.829
"Oh dear. what's going on?"

1430
01:58:44.167 --> 01:58:47.489
"Nobody really knows."

1431
01:58:47.583 --> 01:58:50.416
"But if this is a tale of love.."

1432
01:58:50.500 --> 01:58:53.697
"..then so be it."

1433
01:59:23.042 --> 01:59:28.412
"Please move away for a while.
so I can collect my feelings.."

1434
01:59:29.333 --> 01:59:34.657
"..and calm the
violent beating of my heart."

1435
01:59:35.833 --> 01:59:42.113
"Let's slow down so that we
don't move ahead of time."

1436
01:59:42.208 --> 01:59:48.613
"Oh dear. what's happening?
Nobody really knows."

1437
01:59:55.167 --> 02:00:00.332
"There is something
between us. don't deny it."

1438
02:00:01.583 --> 02:00:06.998
"And no one know
how far it would go."

1439
02:00:08.083 --> 02:00:14.238
"For you should know. your
heart is not what it was."

1440
02:00:14.500 --> 02:00:17.492
"Oh dear. what's going on?"

1441
02:00:17.667 --> 02:00:20.864
"l don't really know."

1442
02:00:20.958 --> 02:00:23.825
"l only hope.."

1443
02:00:23.917 --> 02:00:27.205
"..this does not turn
into a tale of love."

1444
02:00:27.375 --> 02:00:30.162
"Oh dear. what's going on?"

1445
02:00:30.542 --> 02:00:33.204
"l don't really know"

1446
02:00:33.833 --> 02:00:36.745
"l only hope this does not.."

1447
02:00:36.833 --> 02:00:39.950
"..turn into a tale of love."

1448
02:01:09.542 --> 02:01:12.204
I hope your uncle would be asleep
so I won't have to hear him sing.

1449
02:01:15.667 --> 02:01:16.827
Bye.
- Bye

1450
02:01:19.458 --> 02:01:21.949
Rahul. I forgot to tell you..
- What?

1451
02:01:22.125 --> 02:01:24.491
I can't attend rehearsal tomorrow.
- Why?

1452
02:01:25.000 --> 02:01:27.491
Tomorrow I'm going to Khandala.
- Khandala? Why?

1453
02:01:27.792 --> 02:01:30.249
My sister lives there.
- Which sister?

1454
02:01:30.917 --> 02:01:32.157
She's my dance teacher.

1455
02:01:32.792 --> 02:01:35.579
She taught me everything I know.

1456
02:01:36.000 --> 02:01:37.331
It's her birthday tomorrow.

1457
02:01:38.417 --> 02:01:41.033
If I say no. will you not go?

1458
02:01:42.792 --> 02:01:47.491
I'd go anyway. but if you
said yes. I'd go happily.

1459
02:01:49.625 --> 02:01:52.537
I'm joking. Go on. I'll look
into the other jobs tomorrow.

1460
02:01:52.708 --> 02:01:55.074
Thanks. Bye.
- Bye.

1461
02:02:00.625 --> 02:02:01.831
Rahul's done for.

1462
02:02:17.167 --> 02:02:19.078
Rahul? What are you doing here?
- Hi.

1463
02:02:19.917 --> 02:02:22.624
I have a friend in Khandala.
He's been asking me over for ages..

1464
02:02:22.708 --> 02:02:23.914
..but I've never had a chance to go.

1465
02:02:24.125 --> 02:02:26.662
And since we can't
work without you..

1466
02:02:26.750 --> 02:02:28.741
..I thought I'd meet him.
and give you a ride too.

1467
02:02:28.833 --> 02:02:31.540
As it is you're going alone.
so I thought you'd have company.

1468
02:02:32.208 --> 02:02:33.368
What are you staring at?
Hurry up. hop in.

1469
02:02:33.458 --> 02:02:35.289
If we go early we'll
beat the traffic. Come on.

1470
02:02:36.625 --> 02:02:39.492
Well. why are you smiling?

1471
02:02:39.750 --> 02:02:41.490
Nothing. Let's go.

1472
02:02:41.667 --> 02:02:44.124
Today I'm really
missing my friend. Really.

1473
02:03:02.417 --> 02:03:05.489
Tommy. Ceasar. quiet! Quiet!
- Pooja. I'm scared of dogs.

1474
02:03:05.583 --> 02:03:07.995
Pooja. Get them off me.
- They won't do anything.

1475
02:03:08.583 --> 02:03:11.655
Sister's taking a dance class there.
I'll just go and surprise her.

1476
02:03:11.958 --> 02:03:14.324
Stay here. Don't worry.
they won't bite you.

1477
02:03:14.417 --> 02:03:15.657
I'll be back.
- Sir Tommy. please.

1478
02:03:15.750 --> 02:03:18.787
Want some soft drink? You
can have these flowers too.

1479
02:03:31.167 --> 02:03:33.874
Sandhya. what are you doing?
I'll give you one now.

1480
02:03:34.333 --> 02:03:36.915
You've put on so much weight.
you can hardly move.

1481
02:03:37.292 --> 02:03:41.456
No more chocolates and ice creams
for you. Get it right this time.

1482
02:03:44.292 --> 02:03:46.954
Move the neck. Arms straight.

1483
02:03:47.167 --> 02:03:50.785
You..Why are you laughing?
Shut your mouth.

1484
02:03:51.542 --> 02:03:54.830
If anyone gets it wrong then
no one will watch TV tonight.

1485
02:03:55.000 --> 02:03:57.412
Don't come begging me again.
please sister.

1486
02:03:57.500 --> 02:03:59.456
Please Sister. let me watch TV.

1487
02:04:00.167 --> 02:04:02.453
Look. There comes your dear Pooja.

1488
02:04:03.208 --> 02:04:05.164
Sister. how did you recognize me?

1489
02:04:05.250 --> 02:04:07.161
There's no need to act smart.

1490
02:04:07.333 --> 02:04:09.665
I know all my girls from
the sound of their footsteps.

1491
02:04:10.125 --> 02:04:12.491
Happy Birthday to you!

1492
02:04:12.583 --> 02:04:15.495
What's this? You've
brought me another ugly sari.

1493
02:04:15.583 --> 02:04:17.790
Yes. I chose the ugliest
I could get my hands on.

1494
02:04:19.583 --> 02:04:22.120
Thank you.
- Go on. class is over.

1495
02:04:23.042 --> 02:04:26.910
Where you are going?
The class isn't over yet.

1496
02:04:27.000 --> 02:04:28.740
Now I'm here. and the class is over.

1497
02:04:29.125 --> 02:04:30.661
You're spoiling them rotten.

1498
02:04:30.750 --> 02:04:32.240
They behave well all year round.

1499
02:04:32.417 --> 02:04:34.408
And the moment you step here.
they start misbehaving.

1500
02:04:34.500 --> 02:04:35.990
Sometimes one should be spoilt.

1501
02:04:36.083 --> 02:04:41.658
No! Sir Tommy. No!
- What happened?

1502
02:04:41.750 --> 02:04:46.369
Tommy. no! - Don't
let him go! Nab him!

1503
02:04:46.458 --> 02:04:48.995
Sister! Wait!

1504
02:04:49.333 --> 02:04:50.869
He's Rahul. my friend.

1505
02:04:51.125 --> 02:04:52.240
Your friend?
- Yes!

1506
02:04:53.000 --> 02:04:54.991
Leave him. girls.
- Come on. leave him.

1507
02:04:55.083 --> 02:04:57.165
Tommy. Ceasar. go inside. Go.
- Tommy went?

1508
02:04:58.000 --> 02:04:59.661
They're gone. Why
are you so frightened?

1509
02:05:00.583 --> 02:05:02.869
Hi! Happy Birthday!

1510
02:05:04.792 --> 02:05:05.872
Ok.
- Where are your feet?

1511
02:05:06.792 --> 02:05:09.283
What are you up to?
- I'm trying to touch your feet.

1512
02:05:09.583 --> 02:05:13.201
Do I look that old?
- Not at all but out of respect.

1513
02:05:13.542 --> 02:05:14.782
Give me your hand.
- Pardon me?

1514
02:05:14.917 --> 02:05:16.248
Your hand.
- Yes.

1515
02:05:17.375 --> 02:05:18.455
Nice to meet you.

1516
02:05:19.250 --> 02:05:22.822
Oh. you've caught a cold. Come.
let's go in. - Yes Pooja please.

1517
02:05:22.917 --> 02:05:24.498
Save me from the dogs.
- They won't hurt you.

1518
02:05:24.583 --> 02:05:28.872
You don't know. They're very
dangerous. - Sister. who's he?

1519
02:05:29.875 --> 02:05:33.948
I don't know but
I'll have to find out.

1520
02:05:39.917 --> 02:05:43.205
Pooja. you didn't
tell me what Rahul does.

1521
02:05:43.417 --> 02:05:46.033
Rahul? He directs plays.

1522
02:05:46.250 --> 02:05:49.572
These days. I'm working with him.
- I see.

1523
02:05:51.333 --> 02:05:55.201
I think that you don't
like Rahul specially.

1524
02:05:55.292 --> 02:05:58.034
No. I like him very much.

1525
02:05:58.750 --> 02:05:59.990
Very much?

1526
02:06:00.125 --> 02:06:04.994
No. I mean to say.
he's a good friend.

1527
02:06:05.417 --> 02:06:10.616
Good friend? You
mean you don't love him.

1528
02:06:10.958 --> 02:06:16.203
Sister. Rahul's just a friend.
A dear friend.

1529
02:06:17.417 --> 02:06:21.114
I see.. a dear friend.

1530
02:06:21.458 --> 02:06:23.790
It's not what you think..

1531
02:06:24.375 --> 02:06:26.457
..and in any case. l
wanted to tell you something.

1532
02:06:26.542 --> 02:06:30.205
There's no need to tell me.
I understand everything.

1533
02:06:30.292 --> 02:06:33.034
Stop it. Sister. Sister.
you've got it all wrong.

1534
02:06:33.125 --> 02:06:36.697
Pooja. Pooja.
- Rahul. Rahul.

1535
02:06:36.792 --> 02:06:40.114
Pooja.
- Rahul. what's up? - Hi!

1536
02:06:40.208 --> 02:06:41.618
Hi!
- What's up?

1537
02:06:41.958 --> 02:06:44.620
Nothing. Why are you standing
with the spoon? Come join us.

1538
02:06:45.708 --> 02:06:48.165
Stupid!
- Hey everybody!.

1539
02:06:50.000 --> 02:06:52.241
Come on everyone.
follow me.. this way.

1540
02:06:53.333 --> 02:06:55.494
Okay. Come on.

1541
02:06:57.083 --> 02:06:59.119
If it's not Love. then what is it?

1542
02:07:00.750 --> 02:07:04.618
Sister.. honestly!
- Look here. girl!

1543
02:07:05.208 --> 02:07:07.824
I've known you since you
were twelve years old.

1544
02:07:08.458 --> 02:07:14.124
What your heart doesn't
let you know. it tells me.

1545
02:07:14.833 --> 02:07:18.997
The look in your eyes says
that you love this boy very much.

1546
02:07:19.208 --> 02:07:23.497
Now stop lying to me.
Understood? Okay?

1547
02:07:24.083 --> 02:07:25.493
"Just a dear friend".

1548
02:07:26.458 --> 02:07:27.664
Listen. Sister..

1549
02:07:40.208 --> 02:07:46.249
"l can't recollect
when this happened."

1550
02:07:46.958 --> 02:07:52.578
"It's become difficult to
hide this secret from everyone."

1551
02:07:53.583 --> 02:08:00.239
"If you say so. today
I'll ask God for something."

1552
02:08:00.375 --> 02:08:06.780
"Oh dear. what's going on?
I don't really know."

1553
02:08:07.042 --> 02:08:13.572
"What this leads to..
- Let it become a romance."

1554
02:08:35.750 --> 02:08:40.414
So when is Ajay coming back?

1555
02:08:41.125 --> 02:08:43.662
Nothing is definite. but
he could come at any time.

1556
02:08:43.750 --> 02:08:47.663
Say D.
- D.

1557
02:08:47.750 --> 02:08:49.741
Say O.
- O.

1558
02:08:49.833 --> 02:08:52.245
Say N.
- N.

1559
02:08:52.333 --> 02:08:54.494
Say K.
- K. - Yes.

1560
02:08:54.583 --> 02:08:56.619
Now say E.
- E.

1561
02:08:56.833 --> 02:08:59.540
Say Y.
- Y. - I'll be right back.

1562
02:08:59.625 --> 02:09:01.991
Alright. Very good. Very good.

1563
02:09:02.083 --> 02:09:03.198
Let's start all over again.

1564
02:09:03.292 --> 02:09:05.453
D.
- D.

1565
02:09:06.250 --> 02:09:08.457
Okay. okay.

1566
02:09:09.958 --> 02:09:15.407
D. O. N.
- N.

1567
02:09:16.125 --> 02:09:20.289
K.
- Pooja. give me your hand. - Why?

1568
02:09:20.875 --> 02:09:22.911
I won't hit you! Give me your hand.

1569
02:09:24.000 --> 02:09:25.115
Here it is.

1570
02:09:26.458 --> 02:09:27.538
Here

1571
02:09:27.625 --> 02:09:29.411
What's this?
- Hush.

1572
02:09:30.625 --> 02:09:33.412
Listen carefully to what
I'm going to tell you.

1573
02:09:34.583 --> 02:09:36.539
Ever since you were a child..

1574
02:09:37.542 --> 02:09:41.490
..you've always put
others before yourself.

1575
02:09:43.000 --> 02:09:46.367
I've always been
overwhelmed by your behavior.

1576
02:09:47.750 --> 02:09:51.868
But today this same
behavior has made me sad.

1577
02:09:53.333 --> 02:09:54.573
But l..
- Quiet!

1578
02:09:55.375 --> 02:09:58.742
Sometimes. it's very important
to think of oneself. Pooja.

1579
02:10:00.583 --> 02:10:04.622
I see that you are
running away from your dreams.

1580
02:10:05.500 --> 02:10:07.240
You won't let them come true.

1581
02:10:08.833 --> 02:10:10.494
Don't do this. Pooja.

1582
02:10:11.583 --> 02:10:17.283
Not everybody is fortunate to
have their dreams come true.

1583
02:10:18.333 --> 02:10:19.448
Don't do this.

1584
02:10:21.500 --> 02:10:25.539
Let me tell you something. One
can fall in Love many times.

1585
02:10:27.250 --> 02:10:30.162
True love only happens once.

1586
02:10:34.000 --> 02:10:36.241
The step you're unable to take..

1587
02:10:37.500 --> 02:10:42.039
..Lord Ganpati will help you.

1588
02:10:43.042 --> 02:10:44.873
He'll show you the right path.

1589
02:10:45.667 --> 02:10:49.034
He'll give you the
strength to fulfill your dreams.

1590
02:10:51.375 --> 02:10:53.331
Keep Him with you always.

1591
02:10:54.208 --> 02:10:55.869
I have faith in Him.

1592
02:10:57.250 --> 02:10:58.740
The Lord will set everything right.

1593
02:11:00.292 --> 02:11:01.372
I love you. Sister.

1594
02:11:04.208 --> 02:11:06.369
Stop it!

1595
02:11:06.875 --> 02:11:10.618
I don't want to make
a habit of crying.

1596
02:11:12.750 --> 02:11:13.830
Pooja!

1597
02:11:16.583 --> 02:11:17.663
No.

1598
02:11:17.792 --> 02:11:19.453
No way.

1599
02:11:19.750 --> 02:11:22.332
You are very fat. Sister will
scold me if I give this to you.

1600
02:11:24.208 --> 02:11:26.665
Why are you frightened?
- Pardon me?

1601
02:11:27.000 --> 02:11:29.366
Why are you frightened of
being in love? Tell her.

1602
02:11:29.833 --> 02:11:31.494
Love and me? I was just..

1603
02:11:31.583 --> 02:11:32.663
Okay. give me your hand.

1604
02:11:33.250 --> 02:11:34.365
Give me your hand.

1605
02:11:35.375 --> 02:11:36.490
Nice to meet you.

1606
02:11:38.417 --> 02:11:39.497
Take it!

1607
02:11:40.083 --> 02:11:42.074
What's this?
- This is. in a way. my blessing.

1608
02:11:42.583 --> 02:11:44.369
I'm very stingy in such matters.

1609
02:11:44.458 --> 02:11:46.824
I don't give my
blessing that easily.

1610
02:11:47.333 --> 02:11:51.531
But when I saw you l
thought that perhaps you need it.

1611
02:11:52.583 --> 02:11:56.451
This will help you to say
what you're unable to say.

1612
02:11:57.667 --> 02:11:59.077
Keep it very carefully.

1613
02:12:00.250 --> 02:12:02.491
You get it?
- Got it.

1614
02:12:02.583 --> 02:12:04.869
Bye.
- Bye. - She's on her way.

1615
02:12:05.333 --> 02:12:08.291
If you can't say it. then
I'll say it.. - I'll say it.

1616
02:12:08.375 --> 02:12:10.411
Definitely?
- Definitely.

1617
02:12:11.750 --> 02:12:13.286
Okay.
- Okay.

1618
02:12:18.667 --> 02:12:19.952
Mark my words carefully.

1619
02:12:28.375 --> 02:12:30.491
Bye!
- Bye.

1620
02:12:30.583 --> 02:12:33.495
Bye!
- Good bye. Sister!

1621
02:12:33.583 --> 02:12:35.619
Bye!
- Bye. Sister!

1622
02:12:36.375 --> 02:12:37.455
Okay!

1623
02:12:39.792 --> 02:12:40.872
Okay!

1624
02:12:41.250 --> 02:12:45.163
First. the bride. You can
drink straight from the bottle.

1625
02:12:48.625 --> 02:12:51.492
Okay. Here's to Soni and Jimmy.
Everyone together.

1626
02:12:51.583 --> 02:12:53.619
Cheers. For the most
beautiful couple I've seen.

1627
02:12:53.708 --> 02:12:54.868
And now I'm going to give a speech.

1628
02:12:54.958 --> 02:12:56.073
Excuse me.

1629
02:12:56.167 --> 02:13:01.412
Excuse me. ladies and gentlemen..
May I have your attention. please?

1630
02:13:01.583 --> 02:13:03.949
Aunty. please.. thank you.

1631
02:13:07.708 --> 02:13:09.244
Since I am Jimmy's best man..

1632
02:13:09.333 --> 02:13:13.497
..it's my good
fortune to make a speech..

1633
02:13:14.458 --> 02:13:18.701
..and it's your misfortune
that you all have to listen to it.

1634
02:13:20.875 --> 02:13:23.241
Till today. I didn't understand
how two people can take a vow..

1635
02:13:23.333 --> 02:13:26.166
..to spend their entire
lives with each other.

1636
02:13:27.417 --> 02:13:30.614
I didn't believe in
these vows of marriage.

1637
02:13:30.958 --> 02:13:33.290
And seeing Jimmy and Soni together..

1638
02:13:33.375 --> 02:13:36.538
..only strengthened my conviction.

1639
02:13:36.958 --> 02:13:40.576
Because there can't be
anyone as innocent as Soni..

1640
02:13:41.458 --> 02:13:43.665
..and there can't be a
scamp to beat Jimmy.

1641
02:13:44.917 --> 02:13:48.284
I used to worry that Soni
and Jimmy are too different..

1642
02:13:48.375 --> 02:13:51.617
..to spend their lives together.

1643
02:13:53.542 --> 02:13:58.491
But today. l
realize that I was wrong.

1644
02:14:00.167 --> 02:14:02.283
I'm a little ashamed to admit..

1645
02:14:02.375 --> 02:14:06.243
..that I have
started believing in love.

1646
02:14:08.042 --> 02:14:11.534
The kind of love in
which lips don't speak..

1647
02:14:12.792 --> 02:14:14.532
..eyes do.

1648
02:14:16.292 --> 02:14:21.116
The kind of love that binds
two people together forever.

1649
02:14:23.583 --> 02:14:26.620
And today. I keep
thinking of just one thing.

1650
02:14:27.250 --> 02:14:29.332
I remember something..

1651
02:14:29.417 --> 02:14:33.660
..a very dear friend told me..

1652
02:14:33.958 --> 02:14:36.495
..about God..

1653
02:14:37.250 --> 02:14:41.243
..God has already
brought hearts together..

1654
02:14:41.708 --> 02:14:43.448
..but then He left the
hearts to find each other.

1655
02:14:44.000 --> 02:14:46.241
He made us all in pairs.

1656
02:14:47.250 --> 02:14:50.742
For every one of us. somewhere.
there's one soul mate just for us.

1657
02:14:51.583 --> 02:14:54.165
He made Soni for Jimmy.

1658
02:14:54.875 --> 02:14:56.331
Today. to that God..

1659
02:14:56.417 --> 02:15:01.957
..I give thanks for
bringing Jimmy and Soni together.

1660
02:15:04.000 --> 02:15:05.080
..and I pray that..

1661
02:15:06.125 --> 02:15:11.995
..He may give each one of us the
ability to recognize our soul mate.

1662
02:15:19.208 --> 02:15:21.540
Thank you.

1663
02:16:13.833 --> 02:16:15.164
My bangle?

1664
02:16:19.042 --> 02:16:21.203
Rahul. have you seen my bangle?

1665
02:16:23.167 --> 02:16:25.579
Darn! Now I'm sure I won't find it.

1666
02:16:26.792 --> 02:16:29.249
It was my favorite bangle.
- Mine. too.

1667
02:16:33.375 --> 02:16:34.535
Rahul!

1668
02:16:36.292 --> 02:16:37.372
Come on. give it to me.

1669
02:16:38.750 --> 02:16:39.990
Come here and take it.

1670
02:16:40.667 --> 02:16:41.782
What childish behavior!

1671
02:16:43.708 --> 02:16:44.823
Give it to me!

1672
