become my daughter-in-law..

1916
02:38:26.917 --> 02:38:31.456
..and l. your mother.

1917
02:38:33.333 --> 02:38:34.413
But I was afraid..

1918
02:38:35.208 --> 02:38:37.290
..of how you two would
be when you grew up.

1919
02:38:38.125 --> 02:38:39.831
Whether you would be friends.

1920
02:38:40.542 --> 02:38:42.032
Whether you'd take a
liking to each other.

1921
02:38:42.958 --> 02:38:46.371
Hence. I never
revealed my heart's desire.

1922
02:38:47.125 --> 02:38:48.706
I also wanted that..

1923
02:38:48.792 --> 02:38:51.704
..you should decide. if
at all you wanted it..

1924
02:38:51.792 --> 02:38:53.157
..but not for my sake.

1925
02:38:54.125 --> 02:38:59.040
I wanted you to choose Ajay
out of your own free will.

1926
02:39:00.000 --> 02:39:06.075
You don't know how
happy I am. for I know..

1927
02:39:06.833 --> 02:39:08.744
..that there cannot
be a better girl..

1928
02:39:08.833 --> 02:39:12.496
..than you for my son.

1929
02:39:13.417 --> 02:39:18.161
Just watch. I'm going to
give you a grand wedding.

1930
02:39:19.417 --> 02:39:24.491
You have no idea how happy I am.

1931
02:39:27.250 --> 02:39:28.330
May you live long.

1932
02:40:31.833 --> 02:40:33.539
I want full lights
and I want to see..

1933
02:40:33.625 --> 02:40:35.365
..M6 on both left
and right of stage.

1934
02:40:35.750 --> 02:40:37.991
Suppandi. in a while l
want to hear the music tracks.

1935
02:40:38.333 --> 02:40:42.406
Soni. the elevation
should be three feet higher..

1936
02:40:42.542 --> 02:40:44.658
..or else the audience on stage
right will not know what is going on.

1937
02:40:44.958 --> 02:40:46.823
When Ballu lights M6. one spot
light will filter here on this side..

1938
02:40:46.917 --> 02:40:49.329
..and the audience gets a glimpse
of the entry before it happens.

1939
02:40:49.417 --> 02:40:51.248
Rahul.
- Hi Pooja.

1940
02:40:51.417 --> 02:40:52.907
You just make sure
this doesn't happen.

1941
02:40:53.000 --> 02:40:54.410
I want them in complete..
- Rahul.

1942
02:40:54.750 --> 02:40:56.456
Sure. Sure.
- I'll take care of it. - Yes.

1943
02:40:57.917 --> 02:41:00.033
I need to talk to you.

1944
02:41:00.417 --> 02:41:02.624
The show opens in two days.
we'll talk later.

1945
02:41:02.708 --> 02:41:05.290
Shruti. Soni. you just take
care of this. I'll see you.

1946
02:41:05.708 --> 02:41:06.788
Hello.

1947
02:41:07.875 --> 02:41:10.332
Show me all the costumes of
act three's dream sequence.

1948
02:41:10.458 --> 02:41:13.450
Always sitting with Soni. Never
does any work. - That's not so.

1949
02:41:14.292 --> 02:41:15.657
All are approved?
- Yes. this one's approved.

1950
02:41:15.750 --> 02:41:17.365
Yes.
- Trials done? - Yes. - Rahul.

1951
02:41:17.958 --> 02:41:20.290
Yes.
- Rahul. I have to talk to you.

1952
02:41:20.375 --> 02:41:22.411
Pooja. just a minute. I'll
just finish this.. - But..

1953
02:41:22.500 --> 02:41:26.072
One minute. One minute.
Shruti. Shruti. pay attention here.

1954
02:41:28.875 --> 02:41:31.207
Okay.. tell me
what's the problem? Shoot.

1955
02:41:31.875 --> 02:41:35.367
Rahul. please try and understand
what I am about to tell you.

1956
02:41:35.458 --> 02:41:39.030
Rahul. Nisha's calling you. There's
a call from the auditorium. - Darn.

1957
02:41:39.125 --> 02:41:40.240
I forgot to talk to her.
I'll be right back.

1958
02:41:40.333 --> 02:41:41.413
Supandi you owe with me.. - Rahul.

1959
02:41:41.542 --> 02:41:42.622
Where's Nisha?

1960
02:41:46.625 --> 02:41:48.115
Rahul. please be serious..

1961
02:41:49.083 --> 02:41:50.163
Ajay?

1962
02:41:50.500 --> 02:41:54.072
My name is Ajay. but if you
like you can call me Rahul.

1963
02:41:55.000 --> 02:42:00.245
Fatso! I love you!
- Nisha. you'd said..

1964
02:42:02.833 --> 02:42:04.539
I really missed you.

1965
02:42:07.417 --> 02:42:11.831
Remember Pooja. I told you that
I'd come to get you anytime any day?

1966
02:42:12.167 --> 02:42:13.247
Here I am.

1967
02:42:13.833 --> 02:42:17.155
I came here after
meeting mom. She is so elated.

1968
02:42:18.375 --> 02:42:21.287
Hey. I hope you
haven't changed your mind.

1969
02:42:21.583 --> 02:42:22.663
You're marrying me. aren't you?

1970
02:42:24.167 --> 02:42:25.452
Have you told your friends?

1971
02:42:25.833 --> 02:42:29.371
I was going to.. - Hear that!
I'll have to do that. too?

1972
02:42:29.458 --> 02:42:32.780
Come on. I'll tell them all
that we are getting married.

1973
02:42:33.375 --> 02:42:37.664
Ladies and gentlemen.. I'm
sorry for the intrusion.

1974
02:42:38.167 --> 02:42:41.455
You don't know my name. It's Ajay.

1975
02:42:43.208 --> 02:42:45.039
I'm Pooja's childhood friend.

1976
02:42:46.417 --> 02:42:48.703
And since she hasn't
found a worthy guy..

1977
02:42:49.458 --> 02:42:52.200
..I took pity on her.
and I'm going to marry her.

1978
02:42:52.500 --> 02:42:55.412
Congratulations! - Alright. okay.
Thank you very much.

1979
02:42:55.500 --> 02:42:57.286
Congratulations!
- Thank you.

1980
02:42:59.458 --> 02:43:01.369
Thank you. Okay. okay.

1981
02:43:01.667 --> 02:43:02.998
In three days.
we're getting married.

1982
02:43:03.083 --> 02:43:05.324
..and you all must come.
with family.

1983
02:43:05.708 --> 02:43:07.039
Okay. Definitely.
- We'll all come.

1984
02:43:13.958 --> 02:43:15.038
Rahul!

1985
02:43:20.500 --> 02:43:24.698
Pooja. you're weird. Why
didn't you tell us before?

1986
02:43:24.917 --> 02:43:28.159
We had begun to feel
that you were our Maya.

1987
02:43:28.625 --> 02:43:32.117
We forgot you're Pooja. and
you have your own private life..

1988
02:43:32.667 --> 02:43:36.330
..and your own relationships
and even prior commitments.

1989
02:43:36.583 --> 02:43:38.539
We are really stupid!

1990
02:43:39.083 --> 02:43:42.530
Oh. I forgot..
Pooja. congratulations.

1991
02:43:43.500 --> 02:43:45.161
Thanks.
- And this is..

1992
02:43:46.625 --> 02:43:48.707
This is Rahul. our director.

1993
02:43:48.917 --> 02:43:51.909
Rahul. she likes your name a lot.

1994
02:43:52.083 --> 02:43:54.825
She likes only the name?
- I hope so. man!

1995
02:43:54.917 --> 02:43:56.327
Congratulations.
- Thank you.

1996
02:43:56.458 --> 02:43:59.370
Rahul. I have a request.
- Go on.

1997
02:43:59.458 --> 02:44:02.200
May I take her away for an hour?
- Oh. come on!

1998
02:44:02.542 --> 02:44:05.158
You're taking her
away forever from us.

1999
02:44:05.250 --> 02:44:08.572
That will be in a
ceremonious way. What say. Pooja?

2000
02:44:09.083 --> 02:44:12.996
This is just a lunch date with
Pooja. Do I have your permission?

2001
02:44:13.083 --> 02:44:14.744
My permission!

2002
02:44:15.042 --> 02:44:17.749
Now I'll have to get your
permission to meet Pooja.

2003
02:44:18.708 --> 02:44:20.039
Besides. now that you've come..

2004
02:44:20.125 --> 02:44:23.367
..Pooja won't be happy here.
will you Pooja?

2005
02:44:24.750 --> 02:44:27.867
So. go on. I'll get by without you.

2006
02:44:27.958 --> 02:44:30.870
Are you sure?
- Yes. of course! Absolutely!

2007
02:44:31.333 --> 02:44:33.449
You guys go. and
have a good time. Go on.

2008
02:44:33.583 --> 02:44:36.655
We have his permission.. let's go.
- Go on.

2009
02:44:36.750 --> 02:44:38.365
Okay guys.
- Okay. see you.

2010
02:44:38.708 --> 02:44:42.576
Bye. After three days. okay?
- We'll be there.

2011
02:44:58.750 --> 02:45:01.457
Ballu. show me the final mix.

2012
02:45:02.792 --> 02:45:05.829
Shruti. show me the sketches.

2013
02:45:07.333 --> 02:45:12.908
And Nisha. call up the
auditorium and tell them..

2014
02:45:14.500 --> 02:45:16.081
The thing is that..

2015
02:45:16.167 --> 02:45:17.703
..in two days we're
going on stage.. - Rahul!

2016
02:45:33.583 --> 02:45:38.623
Lights! why aren't you
showing me the lights.

2017
02:45:39.167 --> 02:45:41.829
There are just two days.
and you're taking it easy!.

2018
02:45:42.208 --> 02:45:43.448
Come on. the lights.

2019
02:45:44.542 --> 02:45:45.657
Shruti. show me the sketches.

2020
02:45:46.042 --> 02:45:47.953
Quickly bring the
sketches here. fast!

2021
02:45:48.708 --> 02:45:51.040
Tania. hurry up with the band.

2022
02:45:51.542 --> 02:45:53.624
We've got to finish the
music rehearsals. too!

2023
02:45:53.708 --> 02:45:54.788
Come on. everybody.

2024
02:45:54.875 --> 02:45:56.831
Faster everybody. Come on.

2025
02:46:00.958 --> 02:46:02.323
This is our last meeting.

2026
02:46:04.125 --> 02:46:05.456
I'm getting married tomorrow.

2027
02:46:07.208 --> 02:46:10.871
I don't want to meet you
ever again after today.

2028
02:46:12.667 --> 02:46:16.330
Just assume that I was
never a part of your life.

2029
02:46:29.583 --> 02:46:33.451
As soon as I start to move.
track me with the spotlight..

2030
02:46:34.667 --> 02:46:37.409
..and the other will stay on Pooja.

2031
02:46:39.292 --> 02:46:41.248
When I get right
up to the audience..

2032
02:46:42.458 --> 02:46:44.699
..then slowly dim the light.

2033
02:46:46.792 --> 02:46:47.872
The show will be over..

2034
02:46:49.833 --> 02:46:50.913
The End.

2035
02:46:53.292 --> 02:46:54.372
That's it.

2036
02:46:54.833 --> 02:46:56.039
Any questions?

2037
02:46:56.375 --> 02:46:59.447
I don't want any mistakes. okay?
- Okay!

2038
02:46:59.542 --> 02:47:00.702
Raj. everything all right?
- Yes.

2039
02:47:01.083 --> 02:47:04.530
Okay then. tomorrow be
at the stadium on time.

2040
02:47:05.250 --> 02:47:06.706
Pack up?
- I'll take that. - All Right.

2041
02:47:06.917 --> 02:47:10.910
Hey. Rahul. Something
is bothering me. - What?

2042
02:47:11.458 --> 02:47:14.120
I don't like the end of your story.
- Why?

2043
02:47:15.333 --> 02:47:18.040
This ending's too sad.

2044
02:47:19.125 --> 02:47:21.662
A love story should
always have a happy ending.

2045
02:47:22.333 --> 02:47:25.291
The audience should
come out smiling. right?

2046
02:47:26.917 --> 02:47:29.078
People like to
live in a dream world.

2047
02:47:30.417 --> 02:47:31.998
They have seen many dreams..

2048
02:47:33.333 --> 02:47:35.073
..now let them see a little reality.

2049
02:47:36.792 --> 02:47:39.499
Every love story is
like this in real life.

2050
02:47:40.750 --> 02:47:44.993
Full of sorrow and pain.

2051
02:47:50.833 --> 02:47:53.870
No. Nisha. This ending
is absolutely right.

2052
02:47:55.708 --> 02:48:00.327
There can't be another
end to this love story.

2053
02:49:01.875 --> 02:49:05.663
"l know a girl. when she smiles.."

2054
02:49:06.208 --> 02:49:09.951
"..it rains."

2055
02:49:10.625 --> 02:49:14.573
"l know a boy. when he sings.."

2056
02:49:14.833 --> 02:49:18.746
"..it rains."

2057
02:49:35.083 --> 02:49:37.449
Jimmy. just go and check the
next entry stage left. - Okay.

2058
02:49:53.667 --> 02:49:57.239
The heart is crazy.
just refuses to listen.

2059
02:50:26.000 --> 02:50:32.121
"Oh dear. what's going on?
I don't really know."

2060
02:50:32.583 --> 02:50:39.079
"I only hope this does
not turn into a romance."

2061
02:50:39.167 --> 02:50:45.242
"Oh dear. what's going on?
I don't really know."

2062
02:50:45.750 --> 02:50:52.155
"But if this is a romance.
then so be it."

2063
02:51:32.667 --> 02:51:35.955
Pooja's last entry is after this.
Get her ready. and bring her here.

2064
02:51:36.083 --> 02:51:38.290
Don't worry. Nisha's getting
her ready. and bringing her.

2065
02:51:41.542 --> 02:51:42.622
Thanks.

2066
02:51:45.000 --> 02:51:46.581
Don't make this mistake. Pooja.

2067
02:51:49.125 --> 02:51:52.492
Very few people are lucky..

2068
02:51:52.583 --> 02:51:56.997
..enough to love and to be loved.

2069
02:51:59.542 --> 02:52:04.741
You can't break the tie
which He has ordained.

2070
02:52:06.375 --> 02:52:07.865
You can't break it.

2071
02:52:12.417 --> 02:52:18.037
I've spent my years giving
love the name of friendship.

2072
02:52:20.000 --> 02:52:23.447
Now. you're going to
spend the rest of your life..

2073
02:52:23.542 --> 02:52:27.205
..giving
friendship the name of love.

2074
02:52:28.708 --> 02:52:30.118
This is a betrayal!

2075
02:52:31.000 --> 02:52:34.322
A betrayal of love.. a
betrayal of friendship.

2076
02:52:35.417 --> 02:52:36.827
Don't do such a thing!

2077
02:52:50.833 --> 02:52:52.243
This is our last meeting.

2078
02:52:53.750 --> 02:52:55.206
I'm getting married tomorrow.

2079
02:52:57.000 --> 02:52:59.867
I don't want to meet you
ever again after today.

2080
02:53:01.958 --> 02:53:04.620
Just assume that I was
never a part of your life.

2081
02:53:22.542 --> 02:53:25.375
I want to ask you
something before I go.

2082
02:53:28.792 --> 02:53:31.534
Did you ever love me..

2083
02:53:31.625 --> 02:53:37.575
..even for a single
day or a single moment?

2084
02:53:40.083 --> 02:53:43.405
This line is not in the play.
- Raju!

2085
02:53:44.250 --> 02:53:45.581
Tell me just once..

2086
02:53:47.000 --> 02:53:51.414
..have you ever really
loved me? Even for a moment?

2087
02:53:54.000 --> 02:53:56.412
What is Rahul saying?
- Shut up.

2088
02:54:02.000 --> 02:54:04.412
I won't leave without an
answer to this question.

2089
02:54:07.000 --> 02:54:08.581
I'm not going!

2090
02:54:11.458 --> 02:54:16.873
Did you ever love me.
even for a single moment?

2091
02:54:20.000 --> 02:54:21.911
No.
- What did you say?

2092
02:54:23.417 --> 02:54:24.577
I didn't hear that.

2093
02:54:25.833 --> 02:54:30.031
No.
- Speak up. I couldn't hear.

2094
02:54:32.042 --> 02:54:35.284
No.
- Louder. louder Pooja..

2095
02:54:35.375 --> 02:54:39.118
No. I've never loved you.

2096
02:54:40.625 --> 02:54:43.947
Not for a day. not for a moment.

2097
02:54:45.500 --> 02:54:46.580
Never.

2098
02:54:50.042 --> 02:54:51.623
That is all I wanted to hear.

2099
02:55:00.875 --> 02:55:05.414
Rahul.. you'll
remember my name. won't you?

2100
02:55:29.667 --> 02:55:31.999
What can I tell you about Rahul?

2101
02:55:32.250 --> 02:55:33.660
Where do I begin?

2102
02:55:34.167 --> 02:55:39.537
Well. you should realize that
I've never met anyone like him.

2103
02:55:40.292 --> 02:55:43.534
Sometimes he's an angel.
sometimes. a devil.

2104
02:55:44.125 --> 02:55:47.117
Sometimes he's crazy.
sometimes he's a genius.

2105
02:55:47.958 --> 02:55:49.664
Sometimes. he scolds so harshly..

2106
02:55:49.750 --> 02:55:53.072
..and sometimes he makes
funny faces and makes me laugh.

2107
02:55:54.167 --> 02:55:56.704
At times he's more
stubborn than a child..

2108
02:55:56.792 --> 02:56:00.205
..and at times he's
a beloved companion.

2109
02:56:01.375 --> 02:56:06.699
What he is or is not. I
cannot really express in words..

2110
02:56:06.792 --> 02:56:11.206
..but I don't know why.
I feel that..

2111
02:56:30.167 --> 02:56:34.581
..when he looks at me.
I feel beautiful.

2112
02:56:36.750 --> 02:56:40.743
When he laughs. I feel like dancing.

2113
02:56:41.500 --> 02:56:45.163
When he's upset. I feel
like holding him in my arms.

2114
02:56:45.750 --> 02:56:49.572
When he loves me. my
eyes fill with tears.

2115
02:56:51.583 --> 02:56:53.744
He's made me realize..

2116
02:56:53.833 --> 02:56:58.156
..that I am made for him..
and he for me.

2117
02:57:00.333 --> 02:57:02.415
I love him very much..

2118
02:57:03.917 --> 02:57:07.535
..not for one day or one moment..

2119
02:57:09.042 --> 02:57:10.532
..but for my whole life.

2120
02:57:12.792 --> 02:57:15.784
I love you. Rahul. I love you.

2121
02:57:43.667 --> 02:57:44.747
Yes.

2122
02:57:45.417 --> 02:57:46.452
Rahul!

2123
02:57:49.375 --> 02:57:52.788
Now that I've seen them. l
believe that someone. somewhere..

2124
02:57:52.875 --> 02:57:53.955
..was made for me as well.

2125
02:57:55.375 --> 02:57:57.115
Isn't that so?
- Yes.

2126
02:58:00.083 --> 02:58:02.495
My name is Ajay. Yours?

2127
02:58:02.583 --> 02:58:05.074
I'm Nisha.
- Nisha!

2128
02:58:06.417 --> 02:58:09.079
Are you married?
- What?

2129
02:58:25.667 --> 02:58:34.621
"The heart is crazy.
the heart is besotted."

2130
02:58:34.875 --> 02:58:43.374
"It brings along sleepless nights.
It steals sleep and solace."

2131
02:58:43.625 --> 02:58:47.322
"It shows them the path of love."

2132
02:58:47.417 --> 02:58:51.615
"It brings joy and tears."

2133
02:58:51.708 --> 02:58:53.539
"The heart is crazy."

2134
02:58:53.875 --> 02:58:55.615
"The heart is besotted."

2135
02:58:55.875 --> 02:58:58.116
"The heart is crazy."

2136
02:58:58.208 --> 02:59:00.950
"The heart is besotted."

2137
02:59:01.042 --> 02:59:09.416
"The heart is crazy.
the heart is besotted."
